   "text": "10. Eye twitching\n\nThe chart says stress.\n\nStress, poor sleep, excess caffeine, and prolonged screen time can all trigger eyelid twitching.\n\nIf it keeps happening, reduce caffeine, prioritise sleep, and give your eyes a break.",
