   "text": "A chart on coffee timing went viral yesterday. People really want to know when to stop drinking coffee. 😭\n\nHere's the study I found most useful.\n\nIn a 2013 study in the Journal of Clinical Sleep Medicine, 12 healthy sleepers took 400 mg of caffeine (about 2 to 3 cups of coffee) https://t.co/VxUXtzuwq4",
   "url": "https://x.com/ebubxchii_/status/2120184557622133231"
