   "text": "What this chart can't show: you won't feel it.\n\nIn a study, 400mg of caffeine (~4 coffees) 6 hours before bed cut sleep by over an hour. Their sleep diaries missed it.\nhttps://t.co/zZz7Lmr6Ap\n\n\"Coffee doesn't affect me\" might just mean you can't tell. https://t.co/stMjoA2899",
